note SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
note Allen's look, part 4: Allen's presence, the mind of light. Handwritten Omega port of
note native/kernel/ui/mind.h and mind.c (aienux 4b24df65), integer for integer: about a hundred
note sharp points on and inside a sphere joined by fine threads, turning round a compact heart,
note with sparks running along the threads. mdat moves it to a time; mddraw only reads.
note Needs look-paint.om (pkmin pkmax pkabs pkclamp pksin pkcos pkisqrt pkhash pkexpneg pkprog
note pkeaseout pksmooth pkcover pkmix, Lg, Nfrm). The mind's own thread and point mix coverage
note (never add light), so they are private here (mdthread, mdpoint), as in mind.c.
note Statements are short on purpose: every literal and operator of a statement holds one of the
note function's 16 value slots until the statement ends.
note Mdv state slots: 0 cx 1 cy 2 R (px) 3 k 4 ne 5 born 6 t 7 rng (32-bit xorshift) 8 spawn
note 9 mode (0 idle 1 listen 2 think 3 speak) 10 angle (32-bit wrap, 1/256 of a 65536th)
note 11 spin 12 squeeze 13 heart 14 voice 15 nspark 16 alpha 17 hx 18 hy 19 hr (16ths)
note 20 form (0..256 this frame) 21 ca 22 sa 23 ct 24 st 25 scale 26 R16 27 x0 28 x1 29 y0 30 y1
note (the frame's bounding box in 16ths) 31 ta (thread alpha this draw).
note Mdhome: home[i][c] at 3*i+c (unit sphere, Q14). Mdea/Mdeb: the edges. Mdact: how lit each
note point is. Sparks as parallel arrays Mdse (edge) Mdsdur (ms) Mdsback (runs eb to ea) Mdst0.
note Mdpx Mdpy (16ths) Mdlum Mdnear: the frame for mddraw. Mdwords/Mdkeys: when the last four
note pulses began (ms, 0 none). Mdnow/Mdwas: the box now and the frame before; mddirty writes
note their union to Mdbox. Mdclip: the draw rect. Mdp: draw scratch. Mdtab: the mode tables
note (0..3 spins, 4..7 squeezes, 8..11 hearts, 12..15 spark rates, by mode).
global Mdv long 32
global Mdhome long 360
global Mdea long 300
global Mdeb long 300
global Mdact long 120
global Mdse long 64
global Mdsdur long 64
global Mdsback long 64
global Mdst0 long 64
global Mdpx long 120
global Mdpy long 120
global Mdlum long 120
global Mdnear long 120
global Mdwords long 4
global Mdkeys long 4
global Mdnow long 4
global Mdwas long 4
global Mdbox long 4
global Mdclip long 4
global Mdp long 16
global Mdtab long 16
fn mdrnd to long
r = get Mdv 7
s = shl r 13
s = and s 4294967295
r = xor r s
s = shr r 17
r = xor r s
s = shl r 5
s = and s 4294967295
r = xor r s
put Mdv 7 r
ret r
end
fn mdhome i long c long to long
j = mul i 3
j = add j c
ret get Mdhome j
end
fn mddist2 i long j long to long
dx = sub mdhome i 0 mdhome j 0
dy = sub mdhome i 1 mdhome j 1
dz = sub mdhome i 2 mdhome j 2
dx = mul dx dx
dy = mul dy dy
dz = mul dz dz
ret add add dx dy dz
end
fn mdhasedge a long b long to bool
nedge = get Mdv 4
for i ulong ulong nedge
ea = get Mdea i
eb = get Mdeb i
if eq ea a
if eq eb b
ret true
end
end
if eq ea b
if eq eb a
ret true
end
end
end
ret false
end
fn mdput i long c long v long to void
j = mul i 3
j = add j c
put Mdhome j v
end
note one home point: the first 96 on a Fibonacci lattice over the sphere, the last 24 inside
fn mdnode i long to void
y = long 0
th = ulong 0
ln = long 0
if lt i 96
y = mul 2 i
y = add y 1
y = mul y 16384
y = div y 96
y = sub 16384 y
th = mul ulong i 25033
ln = long rem pkhash i 1 31 5900
ln = add ln 13434
else
h1 = pkhash i 2 31
th = pkhash i 3 31
y = long rem h1 32768
y = sub 16384 y
ln = long rem pkhash i 4 31 5734
ln = add ln 4915
end
rr = mul y y
rr = sub 268435456 rr
rr = long pkisqrt ulong rr
x = mul rr pkcos th
x = shr x 14
z = mul rr pksin th
z = shr z 14
x = mul x ln
mdput i 0 shr x 14
y = mul y ln
mdput i 1 shr y 14
z = mul z ln
mdput i 2 shr z 14
end
note the nearest point to i not yet joined to it, or -1
fn mdnearest i long to long
best = long -1
bd = long 0
for j ulong 120
jj = long j
if ne jj i
if not mdhasedge i jj
d = mddist2 i jj
if lt best 0
best = jj
bd = d
else
if lt d bd
best = jj
bd = d
end
end
end
end
end
ret best
end
fn mdedges to void
for i ulong 120
ii = long i
want = long 3
if lt ii 96
want = 2
end
for w ulong ulong want
best = mdnearest ii
if ge best 0
nedge = get Mdv 4
if lt nedge 300
put Mdea nedge ii
put Mdeb nedge best
put Mdv 4 add nedge 1
end
end
end
end
end
fn mdtables to void
put Mdtab 0 349
put Mdtab 1 520
put Mdtab 2 1400
put Mdtab 3 600
put Mdtab 4 0
put Mdtab 5 4
put Mdtab 6 16
put Mdtab 7 0
put Mdtab 8 50
put Mdtab 9 70
put Mdtab 10 120
put Mdtab 11 80
put Mdtab 12 2
put Mdtab 13 6
put Mdtab 14 25
put Mdtab 15 12
end
note (cx, cy) its centre and k the scale from Lg; born the time it starts to gather (ms)
fn mdinit born long to void
for i ulong 32
put Mdv i 0
end
for i ulong 120
put Mdact i 0
end
for i ulong 4
put Mdwords i 0
put Mdkeys i 0
put Mdnow i 0
put Mdwas i 0
put Mdbox i 0
end
k = get Lg 2
put Mdv 0 get Lg 3
put Mdv 1 get Lg 4
r = mul 118 k
r = add r 128
put Mdv 2 div r 256
put Mdv 3 k
put Mdv 5 born
put Mdv 7 2654435769
put Mdv 11 349
mdtables
for i ulong 120
mdnode long i
end
mdedges
end
fn mdmode m long t long to void
put Mdv 9 m
end
fn mdword t long to void
put Mdwords 3 get Mdwords 2
put Mdwords 2 get Mdwords 1
put Mdwords 1 get Mdwords 0
if eq t 0
put Mdwords 0 1
else
put Mdwords 0 t
end
end
fn mdkey t long to void
put Mdkeys 3 get Mdkeys 2
put Mdkeys 2 get Mdkeys 1
put Mdkeys 1 get Mdkeys 0
if eq t 0
put Mdkeys 0 1
else
put Mdkeys 0 t
end
end
fn mdvoice lvl long to void
if gt lvl 256
lvl = 256
end
put Mdv 14 lvl
end
note the thread leaving from that the spark takes: e or the next one round that touches from
fn mdsedge e long from long to long
nedge = get Mdv 4
tries = long 0
note at most ne + 1 passes: tries reaches ne or an edge of from is found
while true bound 400
if eq get Mdea e from
break
end
if eq get Mdeb e from
break
end
if ge tries nedge
break
end
tries = add tries 1
e = add e 1
e = rem e nedge
end
ret e
end
note a spark on a thread leaving from, or on any thread when from is out of range
fn mdspark from long to void
ns = get Mdv 15
nedge = get Mdv 4
if ge ns 64
ret
end
if eq nedge 0
ret
end
e = rem mdrnd nedge
back = long 0
if lt from 120
e = mdsedge e from
if eq get Mdeb e from
back = 1
end
else
back = and mdrnd 1
end
put Mdse ns e
put Mdsback ns back
put Mdst0 ns get Mdv 6
if eq get Mdv 9 2
e = rem mdrnd 260
put Mdsdur ns add e 240
else
e = rem mdrnd 480
put Mdsdur ns add e 420
end
put Mdv 15 add ns 1
end
fn mdtoward cur long want long dt long ms long to long
d = sub want cur
step = pkmin dt ms
step = mul d step
step = div step ms
if eq step 0
if ne d 0
if ne dt 0
step = 1
if lt d 0
step = -1
end
end
end
end
ret add cur step
end
note (1 - (off/width)^2)^2, 0..256
fn mdpulse off long width long to long
if le off neg width
ret 0
end
if ge off width
ret 0
end
q = mul off off
q = mul q 256
w2 = mul width width
q = div q w2
q = sub 256 q
q = mul q q
ret shr q 8
end
note ulong (t * 65536 as uint32) / period
fn mdphase t long period long to ulong
p = mul t 65536
p = and p 4294967295
ret ulong div p period
end
note spin, squeeze and heart eased toward the mode's
fn mdease md long dt long t long to void
put Mdv 11 mdtoward get Mdv 11 get Mdtab md dt 700
w = add md 4
put Mdv 12 mdtoward get Mdv 12 get Mdtab w dt 500
w = add md 8
wh = get Mdtab w
ms = long 400
if eq md 3
w = mul get Mdv 14 120
w = div w 256
wh = add wh w
ms = 80
end
if eq md 2
w = pksin mdphase t 900
w = add w 16384
w = mul w 30
w = shr w 15
wh = add wh w
end
put Mdv 13 mdtoward get Mdv 13 wh dt ms
end
note copy spark slot a over slot b
fn mdscopy a long b long to void
put Mdse b get Mdse a
put Mdsdur b get Mdsdur a
put Mdsback b get Mdsback a
put Mdst0 b get Mdst0 a
end
note spark i arrives: its point lights, and the spark may go on
fn mdarrived md long i long to void
e = get Mdse i
dest = get Mdeb e
if ne get Mdsback i 0
dest = get Mdea e
end
put Mdact dest 256
ns = sub get Mdv 15 1
put Mdv 15 ns
mdscopy ns i
r = rem mdrnd 100
go = false
if eq md 2
if lt r 70
go = true
end
else
if lt r 18
go = true
end
end
if go
mdspark dest
end
end
fn mdarrive md long t long to void
i = long 0
note each pass moves i on or removes one of the at most 64 sparks that were there
while lt i get Mdv 15 bound 200
age = sub t get Mdst0 i
if lt age get Mdsdur i
i = add i 1
else
mdarrived md i
end
end
end
fn mddecay dt long to void
f = mul dt 256
f = div f 260
f = long pkexpneg ulong f
for i ulong 120
a = mul get Mdact i f
put Mdact i shr a 16
end
end
note the shape this frame: breathing, drawn in while thinking, gathered in while being born
fn mdshape t long form long to void
b = pksin mdphase t 5500
b = mul b 1966
b = shr b 14
sq = mul get Mdv 12 65536
sq = div sq 256
scale = add 65536 b
scale = sub scale sq
gather = long pkeaseout form
gather = sub 256 gather
b = mul gather 560
b = div b 256
b = add b 256
scale = mul scale b
put Mdv 25 shr scale 8
sw = mul gather gather
sw = shr sw 8
sw = mul sw 256
b = shr get Mdv 10 8
b = add b sw
b = and b 4294967295
put Mdv 16 long pksmooth mul form 3
put Mdv 21 pkcos ulong b
put Mdv 22 pksin ulong b
put Mdv 23 pkcos 3641
put Mdv 24 pksin 3641
put Mdv 26 mul get Mdv 2 16
put Mdv 27 mul get Mdv 0 16
put Mdv 28 get Mdv 27
put Mdv 29 mul get Mdv 1 16
put Mdv 30 get Mdv 29
end
note turn about the upright axis: rz
fn mdrz i long to long
x = mul mdhome i 0 get Mdv 22
z = mul mdhome i 2 get Mdv 21
x = add x z
ret shr x 14
end
fn mdrx i long to long
x = mul mdhome i 0 get Mdv 21
z = mul mdhome i 2 get Mdv 22
x = sub x z
ret shr x 14
end
note c*16 + 8 + (v * persp >> 14) * R16 / 16384 * scale / 65536
fn mdscreen c long v long persp long to long
v = mul v persp
v = shr v 14
v = mul v get Mdv 26
v = div v 16384
v = mul v get Mdv 25
v = div v 65536
c = mul c 16
c = add c 8
ret add c v
end
note (uint32_t) of the nearness then capped at 256: a negative value wraps past 256
fn mdnear32 v long to long
if lt v 0
ret 256
end
if gt v 256
ret 256
end
ret v
end
fn mdproj i long to void
rz = mdrz i
y = mdhome i 1
ry = mul y get Mdv 23
fz = mul rz get Mdv 24
ry = sub ry fz
ry = shr ry 14
fz = mul y get Mdv 24
y = mul rz get Mdv 23
fz = add fz y
fz = shr fz 14
persp = mul fz 3
persp = div persp 16
persp = add persp 16384
put Mdpx i mdscreen get Mdv 0 mdrx i persp
put Mdpy i mdscreen get Mdv 1 ry persp
fz = add fz 16384
fz = mul fz 256
put Mdnear i mdnear32 div fz 32768
end
fn mdrad i long to long
x = mdhome i 0
x = mul x x
y = mdhome i 1
y = mul y y
z = mdhome i 2
z = mul z z
x = add add x y z
x = long pkisqrt ulong x
x = mul x 256
ret div x 16384
end
note the light a word pulse of this age gives a point at rad
fn mdwpulse rad long age long to long
o = mul age 300
o = div o 600
o = sub rad o
p = mdpulse o 70
o = sub 900 age
p = mul p o
p = div p 900
p = mul p 150
ret shr p 8
end
note the light a key pulse of this age gives a point at ny
fn mdkpulse ny long age long to long
o = mul age 600
o = div o 500
o = sub 300 o
o = sub ny o
p = mdpulse o 60
o = sub 600 age
p = mul p o
p = div p 600
p = mul p 90
ret shr p 8
end
note light from the pulses: words outward from the heart, keys upward from below
fn mdpulses rad long ny long t long to long
extra = long 0
for w ulong 4
wt = get Mdwords w
if ne wt 0
if le wt t
age = sub t wt
if lt age 900
extra = add extra mdwpulse rad age
end
end
end
wt = get Mdkeys w
if ne wt 0
if le wt t
age = sub t wt
if lt age 600
extra = add extra mdkpulse ny age
end
end
end
end
ret extra
end
fn mdlight i long t long to void
rad = mdrad i
ny = mdhome i 1
ny = mul ny 256
ny = div ny 16384
l = mdpulses rad ny t
nr = get Mdnear i
nr = mul nr nr
nr = div nr 256
nr = mul nr 180
nr = div nr 256
l = add l nr
l = add l 34
nr = mul get Mdact i 120
nr = div nr 256
l = add l nr
if gt l 256
l = 256
end
put Mdlum i l
end
fn mdgrow i long to void
put Mdv 27 pkmin get Mdv 27 get Mdpx i
put Mdv 28 pkmax get Mdv 28 get Mdpx i
put Mdv 29 pkmin get Mdv 29 get Mdpy i
put Mdv 30 pkmax get Mdv 30 get Mdpy i
end
note the native-pixel heart and the box round everything
fn mdboxup to void
hx = mul get Mdv 0 16
hx = add hx 8
hy = mul get Mdv 1 16
hy = add hy 8
put Mdv 17 hx
put Mdv 18 hy
put Mdv 19 24
x0 = sub get Mdv 27 48
x0 = pkmin x0 sub hx 40
x1 = add get Mdv 28 48
x1 = pkmax x1 add hx 40
y0 = sub get Mdv 29 48
y0 = pkmin y0 sub hy 40
y1 = add get Mdv 30 48
y1 = pkmax y1 add hy 40
put Mdnow 0 sub shr x0 4 1
put Mdnow 1 sub shr y0 4 1
x1 = sub x1 x0
x1 = shr x1 4
put Mdnow 2 add x1 3
y1 = sub y1 y0
y1 = shr y1 4
put Mdnow 3 add y1 3
end
note sparks are born at the mode's rate
fn mdspawn md long dt long to void
w = add md 12
w = mul get Mdtab w dt
spawn = add get Mdv 8 w
note spawn grows by at most 25*250 per frame
while ge spawn 1000 bound 999999
spawn = sub spawn 1000
mdspark 120
end
put Mdv 8 spawn
end
fn mdat t long to void
dt = long 0
if gt t get Mdv 6
dt = sub t get Mdv 6
end
if gt dt 250
dt = 250
end
put Mdv 6 t
for i ulong 4
put Mdwas i get Mdnow i
end
if lt t get Mdv 5
put Mdv 16 0
for i ulong 4
put Mdnow i 0
end
ret
end
md = and get Mdv 9 3
mdease md dt t
dt2 = mul get Mdv 11 dt
dt2 = add dt2 get Mdv 10
put Mdv 10 and dt2 4294967295
born = get Mdv 5
dt2 = add born 3000
form = pkprog ulong t ulong born ulong dt2
put Mdv 20 form
if ge form 192
mdspawn md dt
end
mdarrive md t
mddecay dt
mdshape t form
for i ulong 120
mdproj long i
mdlight long i t
mdgrow long i
end
mdboxup
end
fn mdcopy4 which long to void
for i ulong 4
if eq which 0
put Mdbox i get Mdnow i
else
put Mdbox i get Mdwas i
end
end
end
note what needs redrawing: the union of where it was and where it is, into Mdbox
fn mddirty to void
if le get Mdwas 2 0
mdcopy4 0
ret
end
if le get Mdwas 3 0
mdcopy4 0
ret
end
if le get Mdnow 2 0
mdcopy4 1
ret
end
if le get Mdnow 3 0
mdcopy4 1
ret
end
x0 = pkmin get Mdwas 0 get Mdnow 0
y0 = pkmin get Mdwas 1 get Mdnow 1
put Mdbox 0 x0
put Mdbox 1 y0
x1 = add get Mdwas 0 get Mdwas 2
x1 = pkmax x1 add get Mdnow 0 get Mdnow 2
put Mdbox 2 sub x1 x0
x1 = add get Mdwas 1 get Mdwas 3
x1 = pkmax x1 add get Mdnow 1 get Mdnow 3
put Mdbox 3 sub x1 y0
end
note ---- drawing: coverage-mixed points and threads inside Mdclip and the screen ----
note Mdp 1 cx 2 cy 3 radius 4 color 5 alpha 6 inner2 7 outer2 9 x0 10 y0 11 x1 12 y1 (the pixel box)
fn mdpbox bx long by long bw long bh long to bool
x0 = pkmax bx get Mdclip 0
x0 = pkmax x0 0
y0 = pkmax by get Mdclip 1
y0 = pkmax y0 0
x1 = add get Mdclip 0 get Mdclip 2
x1 = pkmin x1 add bx bw
x1 = pkmin x1 get Lg 0
y1 = add get Mdclip 1 get Mdclip 3
y1 = pkmin y1 add by bh
y1 = pkmin y1 get Lg 1
if le x1 x0
ret false
end
if le y1 y0
ret false
end
put Mdp 9 x0
put Mdp 10 y0
put Mdp 11 x1
put Mdp 12 y1
ret true
end
note mix the point's colour into frame word idx with this coverage
fn mdpmix idx ulong cov ulong to void
a = mul cov ulong get Mdp 5
a = shr a 8
put Nfrm idx uint pkmix ulong get Nfrm idx ulong get Mdp 4 a
end
fn mdprow y long to void
dy = mul y 16
dy = add dy 8
dy = sub dy get Mdp 2
dy = mul dy dy
x = get Mdp 9
xe = get Mdp 11
idx = mul ulong y ulong get Lg 0
idx = add idx ulong x
note xe - x pixels, at most the screen width
while lt x xe bound 4096
dx = mul x 16
dx = add dx 8
dx = sub dx get Mdp 1
dx = mul dx dx
dx = add dx dy
if lt dx get Mdp 7
cov = ulong 256
full = false
if ge get Mdp 3 8
if le dx get Mdp 6
full = true
end
end
if not full
dx = long pkisqrt ulong dx
cov = pkcover sub dx get Mdp 3
end
if ne cov 0
mdpmix idx cov
end
end
x = add x 1
idx = add idx 1
end
end
note a filled geometric point: constant light inside, one-pixel coverage at its boundary
fn mdpoint cx long cy long radius long color long alpha long to void
if le radius 0
ret
end
if eq alpha 0
ret
end
bx = sub cx radius
bx = sub bx 8
bx = shr bx 4
by = sub cy radius
by = sub by 8
by = shr by 4
bw = add cx radius
bw = add bw 8
bw = shr bw 4
bw = sub bw bx
bw = add bw 1
bh = add cy radius
bh = add bh 8
bh = shr bh 4
bh = sub bh by
bh = add bh 1
if not mdpbox bx by bw bh
ret
end
put Mdp 1 cx
put Mdp 2 cy
put Mdp 3 radius
put Mdp 4 color
put Mdp 5 alpha
bx = sub radius 8
bx = pkmax bx 0
put Mdp 6 mul bx bx
bx = add radius 8
put Mdp 7 mul bx bx
by = get Mdp 10
note at most the screen height rows
while lt by get Mdp 12 bound 4096
mdprow by
by = add by 1
end
end
note Mdp 0 width 1 x0 2 y0 3 len 4 grad 5 radius 6 a0 7 a1 8 steep (after the swaps)
fn mdtin x long y long to bool
if lt x get Mdclip 0
ret false
end
if lt y get Mdclip 1
ret false
end
if ge x add get Mdclip 0 get Mdclip 2
ret false
end
if ge y add get Mdclip 1 get Mdclip 3
ret false
end
if lt x 0
ret false
end
if lt y 0
ret false
end
if ge x get Lg 0
ret false
end
if ge y get Lg 1
ret false
end
ret true
end
fn mdtpx X long Y long yc long a long to void
x = X
y = Y
if ne get Mdp 8 0
x = Y
y = X
end
if not mdtin x y
ret
end
yc = mul Y 16
yc = add yc 8
yc = sub yc get Mdp 2
yc = pkabs yc
yc = sub yc get Mdp 5
a = mul a long pkcover yc
a = shr a 8
x = add mul y get Lg 0 x
put Nfrm x uint pkmix ulong get Nfrm x 7900415 ulong a
end
fn mdtcol X long to void
along = mul X 16
along = add along 8
along = sub along get Mdp 1
yc = mul along get Mdp 4
yc = shr yc 16
yc = add yc get Mdp 2
a = sub get Mdp 7 get Mdp 6
a = mul a along
a = div a get Mdp 3
a = add a get Mdp 6
y = sub yc get Mdp 5
y = sub y 8
y = shr y 4
ye = add yc get Mdp 5
ye = add ye 8
ye = shr ye 4
put Mdp 2 yc
note radius/8 + 2 rows
while le y ye bound 4096
mdtpx X y yc a
y = add y 1
end
put Mdp 2 get Mdp 9
end
fn mdtrun x0 long y0 long x1 long y1 long a0 long a1 long to void
ln = sub x1 x0
ln = pkmax ln 1
grad = sub y1 y0
grad = mul grad 65536
grad = div grad ln
put Mdp 1 x0
put Mdp 2 y0
put Mdp 9 y0
put Mdp 3 ln
put Mdp 4 grad
put Mdp 6 a0
put Mdp 7 a1
grad = mul grad grad
grad = add grad 4294967296
grad = long pkisqrt ulong grad
grad = shr grad 8
grad = mul grad get Mdp 0
put Mdp 5 shr grad 9
x0 = add x0 7
x0 = shr x0 4
x1 = sub x1 8
x1 = shr x1 4
if ne get Mdp 8 0
x0 = pkmax x0 get Mdclip 1
ln = add get Mdclip 1 get Mdclip 3
else
x0 = pkmax x0 get Mdclip 0
ln = add get Mdclip 0 get Mdclip 2
end
x1 = pkmin x1 sub ln 1
note at most the screen's major extent of columns
while le x0 x1 bound 4096
mdtcol x0
x0 = add x0 1
end
end
note a thread whose light runs from a0 to a1, coverage mixed (crossings never add up)
fn mdthread x0 long y0 long x1 long y1 long a0 long a1 long to void
if le get Mdp 0 0
ret
end
if eq a0 0
if eq a1 0
ret
end
end
put Mdp 8 0
t = pkabs sub y1 y0
if gt t pkabs sub x1 x0
put Mdp 8 1
t = x0
x0 = y0
y0 = t
t = x1
x1 = y1
y1 = t
end
if gt x0 x1
t = x0
x0 = x1
x1 = t
t = y0
y0 = y1
y1 = t
t = a0
a0 = a1
a1 = t
end
mdtrun x0 y0 x1 y1 a0 a1
end
fn mdtalpha n long to long
l = mul get Mdnear n 60
l = div l 256
l = add l 16
l = mul l get Mdlum n
l = shr l 8
l = mul l get Mdv 31
ret shr l 8
end
fn mdthreads to void
put Mdp 0 div get Mdv 3 16
nedge = get Mdv 4
for i ulong ulong nedge
a = get Mdea i
b = get Mdeb i
mdthread get Mdpx a get Mdpy a get Mdpx b get Mdpy b mdtalpha a mdtalpha b
end
end
fn mdpoints to void
al = get Mdv 16
for i ulong 120
c = long pkmix 2115728 3174592 ulong get Mdact i
a = mul get Mdlum i al
mdpoint get Mdpx i get Mdpy i 16 c shr a 8
end
end
note the k-th of a spark's three fading points
fn mdsparkpt a long b long g long k long to void
x = sub get Mdpx b get Mdpx a
x = mul x g
x = shr x 8
x = add x get Mdpx a
y = sub get Mdpy b get Mdpy a
y = mul y g
y = shr y 8
y = add y get Mdpy a
g = shr 200 k
g = mul g get Mdv 16
g = shr g 8
k = mul k 4
mdpoint x y sub 16 k 3174592 g
end
fn mdsparkdraw i long to void
e = get Mdse i
a = get Mdea e
b = get Mdeb e
if ne get Mdsback i 0
a = get Mdeb e
b = get Mdea e
end
f = sub get Mdv 6 get Mdst0 i
f = mul f 256
f = div f get Mdsdur i
for k long 3
g = mul k 22
g = sub f g
g = pkclamp g 0 256
mdsparkpt a b g k
end
end
fn mdheart to void
h = get Mdv 13
c = long pkmix 2115728 3174592 ulong h
a = add 90 h
a = pkmin a 256
a = mul a get Mdv 16
mdpoint get Mdv 17 get Mdv 18 get Mdv 19 c shr a 8
end
note does the mind's box meet the draw rect
fn mdmeets to bool
x1 = add get Mdnow 0 get Mdnow 2
x1 = pkmin x1 add get Mdclip 0 get Mdclip 2
if le x1 pkmax get Mdnow 0 get Mdclip 0
ret false
end
x1 = add get Mdnow 1 get Mdnow 3
x1 = pkmin x1 add get Mdclip 1 get Mdclip 3
if le x1 pkmax get Mdnow 1 get Mdclip 1
ret false
end
ret true
end
note the figure into the part (x, y, w, h) of the frame, held inside the clip Lg[5..8]
fn mddraw x long y long w long h long to void
if eq get Mdv 16 0
ret
end
x0 = pkmax x get Lg 5
y0 = pkmax y get Lg 6
w = add x w
w = pkmin w add get Lg 5 get Lg 7
h = add y h
h = pkmin h add get Lg 6 get Lg 8
if le w x0
ret
end
if le h y0
ret
end
put Mdclip 0 x0
put Mdclip 1 y0
put Mdclip 2 sub w x0
put Mdclip 3 sub h y0
if not mdmeets
ret
end
x0 = sub get Mdv 20 128
x0 = mul x0 2
x0 = long pksmooth x0
x0 = mul x0 get Mdv 16
put Mdv 31 shr x0 8
if ne get Mdv 31 0
mdthreads
end
mdpoints
w = get Mdv 15
for i ulong ulong w
mdsparkdraw long i
end
mdheart
end
